   687	    those become this event, the loop halts at AWAITING_USER_DECISION, and the
   688	    user picks one (or steers explicitly). The picked option's ToolCall becomes
   689	    the next action. (The harness circuit breaker reaches the same status but with
   690	    a free-form question, no clickable options.)
